    <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.S2D.StoragePool.FreeCapacity.Monitor"><Name>Storage pool free capacity</Name><Description>Raises a warning when the worst clustered storage pool free capacity falls to or below WarningThreshold (default 20 percent) and an error at or below CriticalThreshold (default 10 percent). Both thresholds are overridable.</Description></DisplayString>
