    <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.S2D.StoragePool.FreeCapacity.Monitor.Message"><Name>Storage pool free capacity threshold breached</Name><Description>{0} Measured value for PoolWorstFreePercent: {1}.</Description></DisplayString>
    <DisplayString ElementID="HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.S2D.StoragePool.Health.Monitor"><Name>Storage pool health</Name><Description>Raises an error when the count of non-healthy clustered storage pools reaches CriticalThreshold (default 1). WarningThreshold (default 1) is overridable and may be lowered relative to CriticalThreshold to create a warning band.</Description></DisplayString>
